Q: What order are paged searchEmployer results returned in?
A: Paged `searchEmployer` results are ordered by **Employer Number (sloc_code)**. This applies whether or not the `pagingRange` element is included in the request (Wiki: RLSI-6059 searchEmployer SBS to support pagination § SFC-04 pagingRange added to searchEmployer SBS), and is confirmed across the acceptance criteria (AC-4 through AC-7), which each state "The Employers are sorted by the Employer Number."
